    {
      "command": "EVENT_TEXT",
      "args": {
        "text": [
          "That man was here again. I told\nhim he'd been warned not to\ncome here. ",
          "He acted like he didn't know what\nI was talking about.",
          "Anyway, he got up and left. He\ndidn't make any sort of fuss, but\nthere's something about him that\ngives me the creeps.",
          "When I look at his face, it's like\nI'm staring at a mask. And there\nis something underneath, waiting\nto get out.",
          "I don't want to be there when\nthat happens."
        ],
